<title>USA: York Financial Corp Q2 shr lower.</title>
<headline>York Financial Corp Q2 shr lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.40		    $0.49</p>
<p> Net			  2,870		    3,387</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,138		    6,904</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.18		    $0.81</p>
<p> Net			  1,277		    5,558</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,088		    6,886</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 first half includes after-tax charge of $3.2 million for recapitalization of Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Provision for loan losses at December 31 was $903,000 vs $700,000.</p>
<p>Assets at December 31 were $1.16 billion vs $1.05 billion.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
